<title>GERMANY: Rexrodt says Bonn against greater EC jobs role.</title>
<headline>Rexrodt says Bonn against greater EC jobs role.</headline>
<dateline>KEMPTEN, Germany 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>German economics minister Guenter Rexrodt said on Tuesday that the German government opposed an increase in European Commission powers on employment policy.  </p>
<p>Rexrodt, speaking after a Franco-German economic summit here, said that had been some discussion on a widening of the EC's role in employment policy across the company.</p>
<p>&quot;(Such a widening) is something we would reject,&quot; Rexrodt said.</p>
</text>
